{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35206","headline":"饮酒乐 · 聂夷中","name":"饮酒乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日月似有事，一夜行一周。\n草木犹须老，人生得无愁。\n一饮解百结，再饮破百忧。\n白发欺贫贱，不入醉人头。\n我愿东海水，尽向杯中流。\n安得阮步兵，同入醉乡游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"聂夷中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35206.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35206","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}